; A node which says something true, written in a form the printer does not
; produce. Nothing here is invalid: it loads, and it is what `dfcad fmt --check`
; is for — the gate's first stage, and the one a model acquires by being edited
; by hand.
(node    site:S-001
        (label   "Meeting Room A")
    (kind Space) (type MeetingRoom)
  (geometry area)
      (frame frame:building))
